  "description": "After being haunted by rumours, because of his previous Sekpa* Slang for sex partner, Beom - who had become sick of it, vowed never to get entangled with another guy from the same school again. But he fell for Mi-Jeong, whose face, figure/body and part (important) were his type! And ended up having a one-night stand with him.  \nHe thought that was it until Mi-Jeong begged him to do it again and he had no choice but to say yes.  \nBut he was surprised when he saw what Mi-Jeong had for him at the hotel.\n\nCuffs, blindfolds, straps.. what's all this?!  \n\"Hyung, please use this 💗...  \nOh and, it's for me.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/be_trained), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jogyo_danghaedda)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/be_trained)",
